     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Not only .., but also ..",
     "texto": [
      "**Bukan hanya .., melainkan juga ..** presents two effects or ideas that add together. Both parts should keep a parallel structure."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Giving instructions with a purpose",
     "texto": [
      "**Supaya** equals \"so that\". It connects an action with the result sought; **seandainya** sets up a hypothetical condition."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
